<script lang="ts">import{onMount}from'svelte';let token=$state(''),status=$state('idle'),error=$state(''),turnstile:HTMLElement;onMount(async()=>{try{const response=await fetch('/api/contact/config');if(!response.ok)throw new Error();const{turnstileSiteKey}=await response.json();const script=document.createElement('script');script.src='https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js?render=explicit';script.onload=()=>{(window as any).turnstile.render(turnstile,{sitekey:turnstileSiteKey,theme:'light',size:'flexible',callback:(v:string)=>token=v})};document.head.appendChild(script)}catch{error='The contact form is temporarily unavailable.'}});async function submit(event:SubmitEvent){status='sending';error='';const form=event.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement;const response=await fetch('/api/contact',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({...Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form)),turnstileToken:token})});const body=await response.json();if(response.ok){status='sent';form.reset()}else{status='error';error=body.error||'Unable to send this message.'}}</script>
<section class="jumbotron container"><h1>Reach out to me!</h1></section><section class="contact-links"><div class="container text-center"><h3>Contact Link</h3><br><div class="row justify-center"><div class="col-4"><a class="contact-card" href="https://github.com/karshh"><img class="brand-img" src="/assets/img/GitHub.png" alt="GitHub"></a></div><div class="col-4"><a class="contact-card" href="#contact-form"><img class="brand-img" src="/assets/img/Mail.png" alt="Contact form"></a></div><div class="col-4"><a class="contact-card" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/karshsharma/"><img class="brand-img" src="/assets/img/LinkedIn.png" alt="LinkedIn"></a></div></div></div></section><section class="form-section"><div class="container"><form class="form" onsubmit={(e)=>{e.preventDefault();submit(e)}}><h4 id="contact-form"><strong>Contact Form</strong></h4><br>{#each ['name','email','subject'] as name}<div class="form-group"><label for={name}>{name[0].toUpperCase()+name.slice(1)}</label><input id={name} class="form-control" {name} type={name==='email'?'email':'text'} required></div>{/each}<div class="form-group"><label for="message">Message</label><textarea id="message" class="form-control" name="message" rows="4" required maxlength="5000"></textarea></div><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website">Website</label><input id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div><div bind:this={turnstile} class="turnstile" aria-label="Anti-spam verification"></div>{#if error}<p class="error" role="alert">{error}</p>{/if}<button class="btn btn-dark" disabled={!token||status==='sending'}>{status==='sending'?'Sending…':'Submit'}</button>{#if status==='sent'}<p>✓ Sent.</p>{/if}</form></div></section>
